# create 유저 생성
POST http://localhost:3000/user/create
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password123",
    "email": "anyany@gangnam.com"
}

### getUser 유저 정보 찾기
GET http://localhost:3000/user/getUser/anyany@gangnam.com

### getUsers 유저 정보 업데이트
PUT http://localhost:3000/user/update/anyany@gangnam.com
content-type: application/json

{
    "email": "anyany@gangnam.com",
    "username": "testuser2",
    "password": "password123123"
}

### Delete User 유저 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/user/delete/anyany@gangnam.com
